  "limits": [
    "Linux Vulkan tested on an NVIDIA RTX 3090. Windows Vulkan and Direct3D 12 packages exercised under Wine on that host; a physical Windows system was not available.",
    "macOS and Android exports passed source/archive/branding/signing checks; target-device runtime testing was not available for this release.",
    "The experimental RT path is Windows/Linux Forward+ Vulkan only. macOS, Android, browser and other APIs retain existing reflection fallbacks.",
    "RT uses one reflection bounce, a bounded scene, a reduced-resolution target and approximate shading; particles, shader-only wind, blended transparency and global illumination are not covered.",
    "Campaign simulation changes already qualified in 1.22.0 were merged unchanged; the complete historical gameplay parity campaign was not repeated for this rendering release.",
    "Browser validation covers actual WebAssembly startup to the installation screen and previous-version cache/data preservation; it does not import or redistribute original game data."
  ],
